# Same line endings on every OS (Constitution Article VIII): Windows checkouts
# would otherwise get CRLF, which changes `dart format` results and file
# contents seen by the project-rules tests.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary

# Audit copies of runs are stored byte for byte (never line-ending converted).
results/*.jsonl -text
# Ready-to-use app archives.
*.zip binary
